---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/landing.css';
---

<Layout
	title="AXIKA — AI Operating System for Industrial R&D"
	description="AXIKA AI Inc. builds the AI native operating system for Design Autonomy in industrial R&D."
>

<header>
<div class="wrap hrow">
<div class="hbrand"><a href="#top" class="logo" aria-label="AXIKA"><span><svg fill="currentColor"><use href="#mark"></use></svg></span><span>AXIKA</span><span>ai</span></a><span class="htag">Design Autonomy for Industrial R&amp;D</span></div>
<nav>
<a class="lk" href="#shift">the shift</a>
<a class="lk" href="#technology">the technology</a>
<a class="lk" href="#approach">the approach</a>
<a class="lk" href="#difference">the difference</a>
<a class="navcta" href="#contact">get in touch</a>
<a id="menuBtn" class="navcta" href="#top" role="button" aria-label="menu">menu</a>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="top">
<div class="stage">
<div class="bg"><img id="hero-bg" class="bgimg" src="/assets/hero-ring-v2.png" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /><div class="scrim"></div></div>
<div class="heroTxt">
<h1>We scale R&amp;D<br />like compute.</h1>
<p class="taglineHero">Design Autonomy for Industrial R&amp;D</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<section id="shift"><div class="wrap">
<div class="cardhead">
<span class="eyebrow bullet">the shift</span>
<h2 class="sec">Intelligence is becoming abundant - scaling R&amp;D gets cheap fast.</h2>
</div>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><p class="body">Frontier models and agents keep getting cheaper and more capable.<br /><br />Reasoning that used to be scarce and expensive is becoming abundant - and that makes design iteration and R&amp;D throughput cheap and fast.<br /><br />With every iteration - learning compounds feeding the optimization flywheel.</p></div>
<div class="card"><p class="body">The effect: R&amp;D output can scale like compute.<br /><br />More options explored, more experiments run, more decisions made - better products, faster and cheaper, with the same team.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="technology"><div class="wrap">
<div class="cardhead">
<span class="eyebrow bullet">the technology</span>
<h2 class="sec">The AI native OS powering Design Autonomy for Industrial R&amp;D</h2>
</div>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><p class="body">Our specialized agents run AI-native workflows that unlock the full design space, on the stack you already have.</p><p class="body">Targeting &gt;80% reduction in design cycle time — faster time to market, earlier revenue, higher market share — with the same headcount and exponential output.</p></div>
<div class="card"><p class="body">Agents find global design optima tailored to market demand, not just incremental improvements on what already exists.</p><p class="body">Automated validation is front-loaded, so costly late design changes, non-conformance and unbuildable variants are caught before they reach the shop floor.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="approach"><div class="wrap">
<div class="cardhead">
<span class="eyebrow bullet">the approach</span>
<h2 class="sec">Industrial R&amp;D at compute scale.</h2>
</div>
<div class="cards3">
<div class="card"><h3 class="cardtitle">Built Around You</h3><p class="body">Every business is different. We build the system that delivers the most value to your team.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3 class="cardtitle">Built to Improve</h3><p class="body">Your system never stops learning. Every decision, datapoint, and correction makes it sharper. Learnings that compound let you improve exponentially.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3 class="cardtitle">Built to Act</h3><p class="body">AXIKA doesn´t just suggest - it executes. Reliable by design and proven in production.</p></div>
</div>
<div class="cards3 stack">
<div class="card"><div class="numrow"><h3 class="cardtitle">Foundation</h3></div><p class="body">Structured context is built by unifying knowledge from internal records, publications, design history, and competitive intelligence - then sharpened with your team's tacit knowledge, expertise, and judgement.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="numrow"><h3 class="cardtitle">Reasoning</h3></div><p class="body">Specialist AI agents bring clarity to complex processes by selecting relevant data, testing assumptions, identifying gaps, and structuring conclusions - with your team following the logic, encoding new strategies, and providing guidance.</p></div>
<div class="card"><div class="numrow"><h3 class="cardtitle">Decisions</h3></div><p class="body">Your team approves and carries conclusions forward, confident every call is data-backed and grounded in the full picture - while AXIKA ensures insights compound and decisions stay transparent and traceable.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<section id="difference"><div class="wrap">
<div class="cardhead">
<span class="eyebrow bullet">the difference</span>
<h2 class="sec">Results you can see. Impact you can scale.</h2>
</div>
<div class="cards4">
<div class="card4"><span class="kicker">cost</span><p class="turn"><em>From expensive</em>to efficient</p><p class="body">Focus resources on what matters.</p></div>
<div class="card4"><span class="kicker">speed</span><p class="turn"><em>From hours</em>to minutes</p><p class="body">Take busywork off your team's plate.</p></div>
<div class="card4"><span class="kicker">accuracy</span><p class="turn"><em>From error-prone</em>to reliable</p><p class="body">Eliminate guesswork and fat-fingers.</p></div>
<div class="card4"><span class="kicker">scale</span><p class="turn"><em>From 9 to 5</em>to 24/7</p><p class="body">Unlock scale and capacity.</p></div>
</div>
</div></section>

<div class="dark">
<div class="darkbg"><img id="contact-bg" class="bgimg" src="/assets/contact-ring-dark.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
<section id="contact" style="border:0;position:relative">
<div class="wrap contact">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column">
<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px"><span class="chip">contact us</span></div>
<h2>Ready to scale<br />your R&amp;D?</h2>
<p class="taglineDark">Design Autonomy for Industrial R&amp;D</p>
</div>
<form id="contactForm" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field">
<p class="hidden" aria-hidden="true"><label>Don't fill this out if you're human: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
<div class="field"><input name="name" type="text" placeholder="Name" autocomplete="name" required /></div>
<div class="field"><input name="email" type="email" placeholder="Email" autocomplete="email" required /></div>
<div class="field"><input name="company" type="text" placeholder="Company name" autocomplete="organization" /></div>
<div class="field"><textarea name="message" rows="2" placeholder="Tell us more about yourself and your goals…" required></textarea></div>
<button type="submit">Submit</button>
<p class="formnote" id="formnote">We handle your details as described in our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
</form>
</div></section>

<Footer />
</div>

<script is:inline>
document.getElementById('menuBtn').addEventListener('click',function(e){e.preventDefault();this.closest('nav').classList.toggle('open')});
document.querySelectorAll('nav a.lk').forEach(function(a){a.addEventListener('click',function(){a.closest('nav').classList.remove('open')})});
/* Fit the dark-panel ring image so its top edge lands on the Name field and its
   bottom edge on the Press & speaking row, at any viewport width. The ring
   occupies y 0.102-0.884 of the source image. */
(function(){
  var slot=document.getElementById('contact-bg'),dark=document.querySelector('.dark');
  if(!slot||!dark)return;
  var TOP=0.102,BOT=0.884,AR=1536/1024;
  function fit(){
    if(innerWidth<=1000){slot.style.removeProperty('--ringTop');slot.style.removeProperty('--ringW');return}
    var name=document.querySelector('#contactForm input[name=name]');
    var press=[].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('footer .flist span')).filter(function(s){return /press/i.test(s.textContent)})[0];
    if(!name||!press)return;
    var d=dark.getBoundingClientRect(),T=name.getBoundingClientRect().top-d.top,B=press.getBoundingClientRect().bottom-d.top;
    /* Cap the RING's width (it spans x 0.409-0.890 of the source), not the whole
       image box — the empty left backdrop may clip past the panel edge. */
    var h=(B-T)/(BOT-TOP),w=h*AR,max=d.width*0.72/0.481;
    if(w>max){w=max;h=w/AR}
    slot.style.setProperty('--ringW',w.toFixed(1)+'px');
    slot.style.setProperty('--ringTop',(T-TOP*h).toFixed(1)+'px');
  }
  fit();addEventListener('resize',fit);
  if(document.fonts&&document.fonts.ready)document.fonts.ready.then(fit);
})();
/* Analytics events: section visibility (event name + section id) and form
   submission (event name only). Never attach form field contents or any
   other personal data to an event. */
(function(){
  window.plausible=window.plausible||function(){(window.plausible.q=window.plausible.q||[]).push(arguments)};
  var seen={};
  var obs=new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){entries.forEach(function(e){
    if(e.isIntersecting&&!seen[e.target.id]){seen[e.target.id]=1;plausible('Section View: '+e.target.id);obs.unobserve(e.target)}
  })},{threshold:0.2});
  ['shift','technology','approach','difference','contact'].forEach(function(id){var el=document.getElementById(id);if(el)obs.observe(el)});
  var f=document.getElementById('contactForm');
  if(f)f.addEventListener('submit',function(){plausible('Contact Form Submit')});
})();
</script>

</Layout>
